# Hygieia — environment variable NAMES only. Never commit values.
#
# Browser (Vite inlines these into the PUBLIC bundle; src/lib/env.ts is the only reader).
# Both unset = LOCAL-ONLY mode: the app runs with no backend and makes no request. CI and the
# Pages deploy build this way until a Supabase project exists (DECISIONS.md ADR-0001).
# Set BOTH to enable Supabase: the SHARED Alyssos project (ADR-0003, ref jenbakghoiaiwceyrshz,
# eu-west-1) URL and its ANON (publishable) key. Never the service-role key.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
#
# Fleet telemetry (optional; VITE_FLEET_* is the fleet-wide allow-listed prefix).
# VITE_FLEET_URL=
# VITE_FLEET_KEY=
# VITE_FLEET_PRODUCT_ID=

# Operator-only, shell env for the migration applier (ADR-0003; never in a .env file):
# SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# HYGIEIA_SUPABASE_PROJECT_REF=
